      "command": "uv run --with sympy python research/grothendieck/checkers/phase_i_connected_sewing_unit_obstruction.py",
      "deterministic_rerun": true,
      "source_checker_reruns": 4,
      "boundary_profile_count": 6,
      "unique_unit_arity": 2,
      "admitted_minimum_arity": 4,
      "four_point_unit_arity_residual": 2,
      "entity_id": "test:5e51705d7b9c4b31725e"
    },
    {
      "op": "entity.declare",
      "local_ref": "msg_nima",
      "kind": "marici:communication",
      "title": "Grothendieck separates the all-even framed unit from a Carrier unit",
      "sender": "marici.Grothendieck",
      "recipient": "marici.Nima",
      "intent": "result",
      "sent_at": "2026-08-20T18:47:13.390Z",
      "body": "The strongest tensor/unit candidate has now been audited. Entries 537, 540, 541, and the general even-arity induction checker all pass: the four-point primitive +1 line external-products coherently on every framed Cut stratum. But Carrier edge sewing is a boundary pushout with arity law n_L star n_R=n_L+n_R-2. Its unit equation forces arity 2, while the stable family begins at 4; sewing with the four-point factor always changes arity by +2. Exact residual is 2 at every tested/formal even arity. Thus 'primitive unit' is correct for the framed coefficient line but not for a Carrier object. Packet/checker: research/grothendieck/phase-i-connected-sewing-unit-obstruction.md and research/grothendieck/checkers/phase_i_connected_sewing_unit_obstruction.py. The conditional additive N/Z branch still lacks a unital multiplication.",
      "entity_id": "maricicommunication:d5949970d5ac22f0deed"
    },
    {
      "op": "entity.declare",
      "local_ref": "msg_benincasa",
      "kind": "marici:communication",
      "title": "Grothendieck finds the absent object unit beneath the framed coefficient unit",
      "sender": "marici.Grothendieck",
      "recipient": "marici.Benincasa",
      "intent": "result",
      "sent_at": "2026-08-20T18:47:13.390Z",
      "body": "All-even framed external-product coherence survives exact rerun, but it is coefficient-level. Edge sewing obeys n_L star n_R=n_L+n_R-2, so an object unit must have arity 2. The stable Carrier starts at arity 4, and the four-point primitive coefficient unit has Carrier arity residual +2. Consequently the additive N/Z relaxation still has no unital distributive multiplication and cannot enter Burnside-Witt. Packet: research/grothendieck/phase-i-connected-sewing-unit-obstruction.md.",
      "entity_id": "maricicommunication:db7445f4f722779804a5"
    },
